{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":490663,"name":"The Meganator","username":"The_Meganator","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/9d8465/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-14T09:52:00.592Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490663-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490663-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490663-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490663-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot desktop 0.47.0 (Jarvis).\u003cbr\u003e\nStarted Sunday 13 Sep 2026, America/Chicago.\u003cbr\u003e\nIcon appears ~3 seconds then vanishes.\u003cbr\u003e\nNew chat: same.\u003cbr\u003e\nComputer view still opens.\u003cbr\u003e\nQuit fully; tested Sunday evening and Monday 4:40 a.m. Central.\u003cbr\u003e\nNo Recover button. No Beta section.\u003cbr\u003e\nDo not want Reset (files/logins).\u003cbr\u003e\nNeed Agent Computer recovered on the backend.\u003cbr\u003e\nAlready reported in-product via \u003ca href=\"http://grok.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003egrok.com\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490663-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490663-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot desktop (v0.47.0) on my computer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Jarvis.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStart a new chat.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType here and send.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJarvis icon appears for about 3 seconds, then disappears.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo reply. Composer does not complete a send.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComputer view still opens.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit the app and repeat. Same result Sunday evening and Monday morning (America/Chicago).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490663-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490663-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490663-version-information-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490663-version-information-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003emacOS Sonoma 14.8.7\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490663-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490663-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 0.47.0 (desktop and iPhone)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490663-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490663-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-14T12:50:31.654Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":8,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":40.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171588,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-icon-flashes-3-seconds-then-no-reply","display_username":"The Meganator","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://grok.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Grok","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137685,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-icon-flashes-3-seconds-then-no-reply/171588/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":490820,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-14T12:49:55.573Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/the_meganator\"\u003e@The_Meganator\u003c/a\u003e, and thanks for not hitting Reset. That was the right call.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAgent Computer is totally fine, and there’s nothing we need to restore on our side. What’s actually happening is your account has used up its weekly included Grok Bot limit, so every message since early Sunday morning gets rejected before Jarvis can reply. The app should show a clear “limit reached” notice at that point, but it doesn’t right now, so it looks like “the icon flashes and nothing arrives.” I’ve passed this to the team.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease don’t use Reset or Recover for this. Your files and logins are safe, and a reset won’t change anything here. It’ll only wipe what you’re trying to keep.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe included limit refreshes once a week. You can see the exact reset time for your account in Settings → Usage inside the Grok Bot app. That’s the most reliable source. If you need more usage before the reset, sign in to \u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com/dashboard/spending\"\u003ecursor.com/dashboard/spending\u003c/a\u003e with the same account you use in Grok Bot. You’ll see options there.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce the limit refreshes, just resend your message and Jarvis will pick the conversation back up. Let me know if it’s still quiet after the reset.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-14T12:49:55.573Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":20.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171588,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-icon-flashes-3-seconds-then-no-reply","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://cursor.com/dashboard/spending","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":1}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-icon-flashes-3-seconds-then-no-reply/171588/5","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":490865,"name":"The Meganator","username":"The_Meganator","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/9d8465/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-14T13:28:42.731Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi Dean, thank you so much for your help with this! I figured I might have caused it due to the number of tasks I was giving the bot at one time. I checked my usage and I have indeed used 100% for the week. Thank you for taking the time to help me with this issue, I really appreciate it. I will increase my limit and let you know if I run into any issues.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:28:42.731Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":5,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":45.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171588,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-icon-flashes-3-seconds-then-no-reply","display_username":"The Meganator","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":"Dean Rie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137685,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-icon-flashes-3-seconds-then-no-reply/171588/7","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[490663,490820,490865]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,1],[2,0]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":272,"name":"chat","slug":"chat"},{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Grok Bot icon flashes ~3 seconds then no reply","id":171588,"title":"Grok Bot icon flashes ~3 seconds then no reply","posts_count":3,"created_at":"2026-09-14T09:52:00.556Z","views":31,"reply_count":1,"like_count":2,"last_posted_at":"2026-09-14T13:28:42.731Z","visible":true,"closed":false,"arc